Subject: cmd/podman: add the exclude_systemd_commands build tag

The tag leaves `podman generate systemd`, `podman quadlet` and
`podman auto-update` out of the binary, for systems with no systemd to read
the units the first two write or to restart the units the third relies on,
and makes the `podman generate` description name Kubernetes YAML alone. It
drops `podman quadlet` and `podman auto-update` from podman(1)'s command
table and `systemd` from podman-generate(1)'s. Upstream's default binary is
unchanged; the documentation hunks apply in every build.

